From: Smartisan ODIN mainline porting effort
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] msm8953: add full ODIN panel database to GCDB and target table

Add the FT8716, Sharp FT8716 and NT36672 1080p panel definitions
generated from the stock Smartisan ODIN device tree, and register
them in the msm8953 target panel table alongside the existing
R69006 cmd/video panels. All five stock ODIN panels can now be
selected via fastboot/lk2nd menu.
---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dev/gcdb/display/include/panel_ft8716_1080p_video.h
@@ -0,0 +1,813 @@
